  "hidden_inputs": "external artifact root (QVG_ARTIFACT_ROOT): the hidden model weights, mounted read-only into the Judge only, and one Judge-only hidden tree mounted read-only at /eval/hidden (MovieGen prompts, the six LongCat init videos, the eleven HY case images and the 17 BF16 goldens, generated by scripts/stage_eval_inputs.py); every input and golden is bound by SHA-256 in the release",
